A '''Sepialot''' is a [[Critter]] in the [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
'''Sepialots''' spawns in the {{zone|Spring Depths}} and {{zone|Spring Path}}. It has a {{Chance|20%|1|5}} chance to be replaced with {{MobSprite|Goldolot}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Sepialots''' swim around before standing still. If a player approaches a '''Sepialot''', a red warning sign {{Mctxt|c|/!\|bold=true}} appears above its head. After {{Green|5}} seconds of the player standing still, the warning sign turns yellow {{Mctxt|e|/!\|bold=true}}. After another {{Green|3}} seconds, the warning sign disappears and the '''Sepialot''' can be caught with a [[Fishing Net]] or a [[Lasso]]. Attempting to throw a [[Fishing Net]] while the warning sign is active causes the '''Sepialot''' to run away and not award an [[Attributes|Attribute Shard]].

